  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities as a single automaton, with states reflecting the robot's current local environment (clear, obstacle detected). The specification constrains the robot to alternate between random_walk and short forward moves in clear states, and to recover with directed turns or full_rotate only when obstacles are detected, ensuring safety and steady exploration. Recovery is conservative but returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
  "strategy": [
